                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "The turn-based strategy expansion where the devs decided basic unit tactics weren't torturing you enough, so they gave all the mages nuclear-level spell spam and set every map timer to \"panic.\" You deploy your shiny new wizard hero thinking you're going to cast majestic high-fantasy magic, only to immediately get swarmed by fifty summoned spectres while the enemy AI snipes your entire backline with sacred dwarf runes from across the hex grid. You spend three turns setting up a glorious arcane combo, miss an 80% spell hit chance, get hit by a map-wide curse, and end up spamming chain-summons out of pure desperation while your frontline gets turned into radioactive fantasy dirt. 10/10 unhinged wizard-rage simulator.",
